<title>USA: Wall Street stocks higher at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks higher at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A strong rally in the bond market took Wall Street stocks higher at the start of trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bond market rally was sparked by favorable first quarter employment cost index data.</p>
<p>Dow Industrials were up 77 at 6860.</p>
</text>
